    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "Every panel reads `task-readings.csv`: one row per merged task PR, written by the `task-readings` workflow. A task appears here after its PR merges. An empty reading is a gap, never 0, and the table's `gap` column names its cause.\n\n**Causes** of a reading are in Langfuse, in the traces of the sessions of the change's `sessions` file ([which labels carry the task](https://github.com/ekolvah/agent-process-distribution/blob/main/.agent-process/docs/telemetry-measurement-setup.md#which-labels-carry-the-task)). **Rule 2** is the *Per-session totals* query in Explore ([per-session totals](https://github.com/ekolvah/agent-process-distribution/blob/main/.agent-process/docs/telemetry-measurement-setup.md#per-session-totals)).",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "13.3.0-37900028434",
      "title": "Reading this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
